Line four, we have this extra component

4
00:00:06,04 --> 00:00:08,00
that we use to keep track of the score,

5
00:00:08,00 --> 00:00:11,01
so each time that you get the answer right.

6
00:00:11,01 --> 00:00:13,02
And this one is visible right here.

7
00:00:13,02 --> 00:00:14,09
So every time that you get the answer right,

8
00:00:14,09 --> 00:00:16,07
it's going to be incremented by one.

9
00:00:16,07 --> 00:00:18,05
So let's try this one out.

10
00:00:18,05 --> 00:00:20,09
I already have my app up and running.

11
